    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve spent your whole life moving through normal space.</strong><br><strong>This game teaches you what happens when it\u2019s no longer normal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.poster.avif?t=1752470277\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.webm?t=1752470277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.mp4?t=1752470277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sophie in the Tangled World</strong> is a quiet, story-driven puzzle adventure. The story follows a girl from early-19th-century Paris who slips into a strange, parallel version of her city, where the rules of familiar space no longer apply \u2014 and the only way back is to master the logic of this impossible geometry.  <br><br><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Topological Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a single step and reappear in the room\u2019s far corner. Watch, experiment, and deduce the hidden laws of non-Euclidean space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silence Instead of Tutorials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule you master is one you uncover yourself. No pop-ups, no glowing arrows \u2014 only time to think and the thrill of a genuine \u201caha!\u201d moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene is filled with with period detail, while a minimalist original ambient score creates a calm, reflective mood that lets every discovery resonate.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve spent your whole life moving through normal space.</strong><br><strong>This game teaches you what happens when it\u2019s no longer normal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.poster.avif?t=1752470277\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.webm?t=1752470277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/ed0961475a077180c78a11bdfe86bf2a.mp4?t=1752470277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sophie in the Tangled World</strong> is a quiet, story-driven puzzle adventure. The story follows a girl from early-19th-century Paris who slips into a strange, parallel version of her city, where the rules of familiar space no longer apply \u2014 and the only way back is to master the logic of this impossible geometry.  <br><br><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Topological Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a single step and reappear in the room\u2019s far corner. Watch, experiment, and deduce the hidden laws of non-Euclidean space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silence Instead of Tutorials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule you master is one you uncover yourself. No pop-ups, no glowing arrows \u2014 only time to think and the thrill of a genuine \u201caha!\u201d moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene is filled with with period detail, while a minimalist original ambient score creates a calm, reflective mood that lets every discovery resonate.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Solve puzzles in bewitching 19th-century Paris, where rooms loop and logic twists.",
